      "note": "<p>Highlighting nice servers to join on Mastodon and the wider Fediverse 🙂 </p><p>This account has a website directory of servers at <a href=\"https://fedi.garden\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">fedi.garden</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a>. All servers listed comply with rules detailed at <a href=\"https://fedi.garden/about-this-site\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">fedi.garden/about-this-site</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a> which includes responsible moderation, technical reliability and defederating Meta/Threads.</p><p>Maintained by <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.chinwag.org/@FediThing\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>FediThing</span></a></span></p>",
